  assumption challenge: alternate vertices considered = runners, gaps, residues, shell unit classes,
    Pisano quotient classes, band-rung events, B' targets, and proof obligations.
    This quotient preserves exact S(r) coverage and the residue mechanism; it destroys arbitrary
    multi-stranger geometry, endpoint-owner data, and nonlocal pressure dependencies.

== Proof-shaped takeaway ==
  HYP-2438's Q lattice is exact on the whole one-stranger family already at Q27;
  the two rows with minimal plain witness q=41 are nevertheless caught at q=91.
  Q41 is therefore redundant for S(r), though it remains the visible band-2 stress test.
  The Pisano quotient explains the residual rather than merely listing it: shell 27
  leaves one antipodal unit class, +-10, and the old evaders occupy that class (or 0)
  while also killing the 13-clock.  Multi-stranger configurations remain the live gap.
